Also mention that if using Mapbox GL JS v2+ you can use map.addLayer(layer, beforeId). Provide note about MapLibre.

Potential pitfalls: If you add before a layer that doesn't exist yet, you need to wait for style load. Use map.on('styledata').

Also mention that you can use map.getLayer('my-layer') to check.

